<title>UK: Cobham extends rally as BZW upgrades.</title>
<headline>Cobham extends rally as BZW upgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cobham Plc jumped the third consecutive session on Thursday as BZW upgraded its profit forecast for the UK engineering concern and repeated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 19p to 671-1/2p at 1106 GMT, having risen to a six-month high at 675p earlier.</p>
</text>
